  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Effort for Elimination of Tuberculosis (JEET) for patients seeking care in private sector / Strengthening Overall Care for HIV patients (SOCH) - India (01-Jan-2018-31-Mar-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, TB/HIV, William J. Clinton Foundation (WJCF)This program has the following goals: To achieve a rapid decining burden of TB morbidity and mortality while working towards elimination of TB in India by 2025. The objectives of this program are: Systematically engage the private provides  with an increase in case notification to 2 million cases annually.  Improving treatment adherence and treatment support byadoption of iCT tools and partnerships</narrative>
  </description>
